<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 44,000 lbs nickel.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 44,000 lbs nickel.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said Friday it had sold 44,000 pounds of nickel to FirstMiss Steel, Inc., in Hollsopple, Pennsylvania.</p>
<p>The nickel was priced at $3.251 per pound, for a total price of $143,044.</p>
<p>The next bid opening for nickel is scheduled for November 14, 1996.</p>
